;color:#4f586a;">Requested time</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.AppointmentTime}}</td></tr>{{if .Amount}}<tr><td class="fact-label" valign="top" width="38%" style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">Estimate</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.Amount}}</td></tr>{{end}}<tr><td class="fact-label" valign="top" width="38%" style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">Status</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.StatusText}}</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">You can confirm the request, propose another time or decline it. No payment is taken on RightProperty365: you arrange payment with the customer.</p>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">The customer's contact details are in your hourly bookings. They are not included in this email.</p>
